OL,3,GNEWSANew method deployed in fight      
OL,4,Aagainst winter potholes                
OL,6,FAs the wet and cold weather rolls in   
OL,7,Facross the UK, a new weapon in the     
OL,8,Ffight against potholes is being        
OL,9,Fdeployed.                              
OL,11,FOxfordshire County Council has begun   
OL,12,Fusing Viafix - a water-activated       
OL,13,Fasphalt compound that is laid cold - on
OL,14,Fthe county's roads.                    
OL,16,FThe method is the first to come out of 
OL,17,Fa two-year scheme to test different    
OL,18,Fpothole repair methods, which began in 
OL,19,FBanbury in June.                       
