OL,3,GNEWSANew method deployed in fight      
OL,4,Aagainst winter potholes                
OL,6,FLiz Leffman, the council's pothole     
OL,7,Fczar, said the Viafix compound would   
OL,8,F"save" the authority's repair teams "a 
OL,9,Flot of time".                          
